Body:
Hi, I found a fix where I used typescript-language-server locally with bun. Now the LSP works :

Here is my config, hope it will work for you :

```
{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
  "lsp": {
    "typescript": {
      "disabled": false,
      "command": [
        "bun",
        "run",
        "--bun",
        "typescript-language-server",
        "--stdio"
      ],
      "initialization": {
        "preferences": {
          "importModuleSpecifierPreference": "relative"
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```
